#NEXUS

[ xu2001a_fig3: Thyreophoran majority-rule consensus, drawn with the outgroup Scutellosaurus at the bottom. The Pawpawsaurus line crosses the vertical of the Hylaeosaurus + 'Other nodosaurines' node and is that node's stem, so the three form a trichotomy as drawn. Read by eye. 14 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 3 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=14;
    TAXLABELS
        Emausaurus
        Scelidosaurus
        Stegosauria
        Hylaeosaurus
        Pawpawsaurus
        Other_nodosaurines
        Liaoningosaurus
        Gargoyleosaurus
        Shamosaurus
        Minmi
        Gastonia
        Pinacosaurus
        Other_ankylosaurines
        Scutellosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE xu2001a_fig3 = [&R] ((Emausaurus,(Scelidosaurus,(Stegosauria,(((Hylaeosaurus,Pawpawsaurus,Other_nodosaurines),Liaoningosaurus),(Gargoyleosaurus,(Shamosaurus,Minmi,(Gastonia,(Pinacosaurus,Other_ankylosaurines)))))))),Scutellosaurus);
END;
